day into one table.","price":"$$","priceSource":"Editorial source review / Google Maps","hours":{"default":"Check current hours before going."},"photo":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533929736458-ca588d08c8be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80","poiId":"poi-united-kingdom-london-borough-market"},{"id":"notting-food-ledbury","name":"The Ledbury","coordinates":[51.5173,-0.2003],"description":"The Ledbury is a serious Notting Hill booking with tasting-menu focus and neighborhood calm, ideal when west London needs the trip''s most deliberate meal.","price":"$$$","priceSource":"Editorial source review / Google Maps","hours":{"default":"Check current hours before going."},"photo":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80","poiId":"poi-united-kingdom-london-the-ledbury"}],"sources":[{"name":"The Infatuation - Best Restaurants in London","url":"https://www.theinfatuation.com/london/guides/best-restaurants-london"},{"name":"Eater London - Essential London Restaurants","url":"https://london.eater.com/maps/best-restaurants-london-38"},{"name":"Michelin Guide - London restaurants","url":"https://guide.michelin.com/gb/en/greater-london/london/restaurants"}]}'::jsonb),
